OL,3,GNEWSAMan who transported Omagh bomb was
OL,4,Aan MI5 and Garda agent, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe detective who led the Omagh bomb
OL,7,Finvestigation has told an inquiry that
OL,8,Fthe man who transported the bomb was an
OL,9,Fagent for both the UK security services
OL,10,Fand the gardai (Irish police).
OL,12,FRetired Ch Supt Norman Baxter gave
OL,13,Fevidence to the Omagh Bombing Inquiry
OL,14,Fsitting in Belfast on Friday.
OL,16,FHe said: "As I went through the
OL,17,Finvestigation it became very apparent
OL,18,Fthat an individual was a Garda agent.
OL,19,FIt became apparent that in one
OL,20,Foperation there was a high potential
OL,21,Fthat he was jointly handled by the
OL,22,Fsecurity services."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
