OL,3,GNEWSAMan who transported Omagh bomb was
OL,4,Aan MI5 and Garda agent, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaxter said he also believed that
OL,7,Fintelligence services were aware of the
OL,8,Fbombers' activity before they carried
OL,9,Fout the Omagh bombing.
